<title>THAILAND: GOLF-SUPER TOUR FINAL SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SUPER TOUR FINAL SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final results in the $350,000 Johnnie Walker Super Tour on Sunday:</p>
<p>274 Ernie Els (South Africa) 67 71 71 65 Ian Woosnam (Wales) 68</p>
<p>70 73 63 (Els won at first play-off hole)</p>
<p>280 Colin Montgomerie (Scotland) 68 72 71 69</p>
<p>282  Park Nam-sin (South Korea) 67 72 75 68</p>
<p>285  Lin Keng-chi (Taiwan) 67 73 72 73</p>
<p>289 Vijay Singh (Fiji) 72 71 78 68</p>
<p>298 Felix Casas (Philippines) 71 76 78 73</p>
<p>299 Chawalit Plaphol (Thailand) 75 71 77 76</p>
</text>
